:: Decision1 {"position":"1150,300","size":"100,100"}
"Well, mortal, how did you die?" The man asked.

You think of the moment you passed from the world. Memories flood your mind.

[[I was at war.->Selection 1A]]

[[I was returning from a drink with a friend.->Selection 1B]]

[[I was escaping from a robbery.->Selection 1C]]


